#!author = ddgksf2013, 可莉🅥[https://github.com/luestr/ProxyResource/blob/main/README.md]

^https?:\/\/dj\.palmestore\.com\/zybk\/api\/ad url reject-200
^https?:\/\/saad\.ms\.zhangyue\.net\/ad\/ url reject-200

# ↓ 来自 kelee:iReaderDejian_remove_ads.lpx「得间小说去广告」
